# LedBox bridge moved to its own repo (point-hub). Only the pointer README is
# tracked here; local leftovers (Tech4Sport vendor firmware, runtime match
# data, agent skill dirs) must never land in this public repo.
ledbox-bridge/*
!ledbox-bridge/README.md

